str_to_weight [SimTalk]
Converts the specified data into a number of data type weight.
Remarks
You can specify one of these units into which the function converts the string: "g", "kg", "t", "lb", or
"oz".
If you do not specify a unit, Plant Simulation outputs the acceleration according to the settings you
selected under File > Model Settings/Preferences > Units > Mass.
Suppose Plant Simulation outputs the weight in a dialog box. Plant Simulation outputs the weight
according to the settings you selected under File > Model Settings/Preferences > Units > Mass. When
evaluating the value, Plant Simulation has to reconvert it to kg (kilograms). The function str_to_weight
reconverts and re-translates the value in a single step.
