timeRepresenation [SimTalk]
Returns the preferences you selected for the time scale under File > Model Settings/Preferences > Units >
Time Scale.
Type
Function
Syntax
timeRepresentation -> list
Return Value
The return value is a DataList of data type real.
The first entry contains the conversion factor for the time. You can only specify the denominator. The
conversion factor is the reciprocal value. The following three entries are the values taken from File >
Model Settings/Preferences > Units > Time Scale. They are normally represented by 60, 60 and 24.
Example
var l: list[real]
var timeDivision: real
var SecondCarriedOver, HourCarriedOver, DayCarriedOver : real
l := timeRepresentation
timeDivision := l.read(1)
secondCarriedOver := l.read(2)
hourCarriedOver := l.read(3)
dayCarriedOver := l.read(4)
See also
Time Scale [preferences]
